      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Like a ghost copy(with a temp  ID) that can only be seen by admins and the author?\nSo the old version stays public untill the new world gets approved.\nGood idea!!!\nSo far I do it by having two versions(ID's) of a map under the same name and add a (WIP) to one of them. \nAs soon as the updated (WIP) map is public I update the main map. But having one world that will stay public even if I upload a new version with the same ID would be great. Once it gets an OK it will replace the old one. \nWouldn't make the system we have now any different or more complicated. But much more convenient for the enduser(no downtime/double favorite) and author(no double upload, no double request). Even the admins would save some time since they dont have to review 2 versions of an identicle world....",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
