  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One thing that is annoying about the reupload of worlds that are already been approved before (so already public) is the fact that they get into private.\nA new version of a world should not forbid everyone to get to the world that *already* got approved, until the new version is approved (or fixed AND approved, if there is issues)\n\nOne side note :\nIf the world didn't get approved just because of the avatar pedestals in it, this is even more punishing for world creators, that cannot show their worlds until these avatars are fixed",
